                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "41d945a3-a556-4f22-891c-6af3d6e88afd",
                        "source_entry_id": "1bed2ae1-ef86-32a3-97c4-7cdac5a13647",
                        "source_sense_id": "4d3eabb8-6355-3c7a-b5ee-3e82b0cd8a87",
                        "target_lang_word": "heifer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heifer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba909ff7-0b25-3f54-ada5-a775f2332873",
                                        "entry_id": "752187a1-efb2-3924-a569-7773ecfb7bf8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A young female cow, (particularly) one over one year old but which has not calved."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b3a20ef-998e-43c2-8341-5b462ff2c611",
                                                "sense_id": "ba909ff7-0b25-3f54-ada5-a775f2332873",
                                                "text": "And the Lord ſpake vnto Moſes and vnto Aaron, ſaying, This is the ordinance of the Law, which the Lord hath commaunded, ſaying, Speak vnto the childꝛen of Iſrael, that they bꝛing thee a red heifer without ſpot, wherein is no blemiſh, and vpon which neuer came yoke."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5746883b-61f2-4508-a208-d33c1603e8ec",
                                                "sense_id": "ba909ff7-0b25-3f54-ada5-a775f2332873",
                                                "text": "We muſt be neat; not neat, but cleanly, Captaine: / And yet the Steere, the Heycfer^([sic]), and the Calfe, / Are all call'd Neat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cc38034-65e7-4c01-b892-918b76b44d4c",
                                                "sense_id": "ba909ff7-0b25-3f54-ada5-a775f2332873",
                                                "text": "The breath of the mountain heifer was fragrant as the gales of Sirendiep, by feeding on ſpicy herbs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "411b7637-4dd8-3a29-891f-35e904a6aad7",
                                        "entry_id": "752187a1-efb2-3924-a569-7773ecfb7bf8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wife."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b75a33aa-f1b5-49ae-af22-82bce16f7424",
                                                "sense_id": "411b7637-4dd8-3a29-891f-35e904a6aad7",
                                                "text": "Her, whom I shall choose for my heicfar."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4089b909-5279-33e9-ba8c-56e63fb881c7",
                                        "entry_id": "752187a1-efb2-3924-a569-7773ecfb7bf8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An unattractive or unpleasant woman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd94afeb-b662-4e1a-af06-335c5806a12a",
                                                "sense_id": "4089b909-5279-33e9-ba8c-56e63fb881c7",
                                                "text": "I have half a mind to marry that heifer, tho' wives are bothersome critters when you have too many of them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cb8afd8-319e-468e-8190-b4db271cdaba",
                                                "sense_id": "4089b909-5279-33e9-ba8c-56e63fb881c7",
                                                "text": "Stop your crying, heifer, I don't need all that, I got a job for you, the braided-up pimp is back!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afaad7df-7050-457a-bad9-54e4272b9099",
                                                "sense_id": "4089b909-5279-33e9-ba8c-56e63fb881c7",
                                                "text": "My hand was aching to slap that silly heifer. I told her to take her trifling ass down to Burger King and get herself a job flipping burgers..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5c010f23-a6cb-4da3-ad82-1bd996e85074",
                        "source_entry_id": "1bed2ae1-ef86-32a3-97c4-7cdac5a13647",
                        "source_sense_id": "4d3eabb8-6355-3c7a-b5ee-3e82b0cd8a87",
                        "target_lang_word": "génisse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "génisse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1873ec0e-d8f8-342f-9f0f-6ff5a17ee6df",
                                        "entry_id": "771a45b4-fd51-3d81-9e3a-481d3e67af43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Jeune vache ou bisonne nullipare."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Élevage"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2deb0a9e-a3ab-4e97-ae36-a8e2ada625bc",
                                                "sense_id": "1873ec0e-d8f8-342f-9f0f-6ff5a17ee6df",
                                                "text": "Voyez-vous, à la tombée du jour, les plus petits courir à travers bois au-devant de l’aîné, qui ramène deux génisses du pâturage ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94e7882b-b713-4ce4-9393-01ef8c02cf26",
                                                "sense_id": "1873ec0e-d8f8-342f-9f0f-6ff5a17ee6df",
                                                "text": "Une bousculade plus violente se produisit ; les petits veaux et les génisses rejetés de droite et de gauche par la poussée des grands bestiaux s’égratignèrent aux ronces flottantes des haies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2c52001-80fa-401b-bf94-ebb59ab02cda",
                                                "sense_id": "1873ec0e-d8f8-342f-9f0f-6ff5a17ee6df",
                                                "text": "Mais si je vous disais que, moi, je l’ai vu acheter une génisse. Je dis une génisse. Pas vilaine bête, bien sûr, coquette si vous voulez, mais enfin qui n’avait tiré l’œil de personne, et lui, la payer tiens et tiens, comme moi j’achèterais deux sous à fumer, et la revendre un quart d’heure plus tard avec trente-deux francs de bénéfice à pas quinze mètres d’où il l’avait prise. Moi, j’ai vu ça. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c75f2760-5963-4619-a71d-af94ef9a99cc",
                                                "sense_id": "1873ec0e-d8f8-342f-9f0f-6ff5a17ee6df",
                                                "text": "Pourtant cette nuit-là, on avait mal dormi : la génisse aux Mortiers vêlait et le Camille y avait veillé jusqu’au petit jour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e72fb8e-4da8-48cb-93f4-f1b4a1067a48",
                                                "sense_id": "1873ec0e-d8f8-342f-9f0f-6ff5a17ee6df",
                                                "text": "Halo s’est donc associé avec l’entreprise Highline Angus pour offrir le grand prix de 20 génisses, de jeunes vaches prêtes à donner naissance à des veaux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
